Millie,

There are some R packages that will fit a Bayesian IRT model that should be equivalent (or nearly so) to an ordinal CFA under the SEM approach. I think brms would do it, as well as the edstan package. The graded response model would be most similar to the ordinal CFA.

Best,
Ed

